      "transferExpectationDe": "Beim N2- oder Ionenschema überträgt sie die Regel:8/2 ergibt3, Entfernen eines antibindenden O2-Elektrons erhöht2 auf2,5; dies ist keine exakte Bindungsenergiemessung.",
      "transferExpectationEn": "They transfer the rule to N2 or an ion:8/2 gives3, removing an antibonding O2 electron raises2 to2.5; this is not an exact bond-energy measurement.",
      "rationale": "The DE/EN description names one assessable diagram-interpretation skill. The actual bound O2 image has12 valence electrons,8 bonding/4 antibonding, correct sigma/pi order for O2 and two unpaired pi-star electrons. The current cases require interpretation and removal-from-antibonding transfer, not merely a molecular-formula label. Appropriate N2 orbital order must be supplied rather than copied indiscriminately from O2. Actual BY C12 gA original includes diatomic MO diagrams; the goal is valid authored science, while its canonical LK tag alone is no proof of official BY course coverage.",
