      "transferExpectationDe": "Sie erkennt Prop-1-en als E/Z-Gegenfall und unterscheidet ein echtes Spiegelbild von einer durch Drehung deckungsgleichen Darstellung.",
      "transferExpectationEn": "They identify prop-1-ene as an E/Z counterexample and distinguish an actual mirror image from a drawing superimposable by rotation.",
      "rationale": "The bilingual wording deliberately specifies supplied pairs with identical constitution, preventing an unqualified classification of any two drawings. Complete cases provide but-2-ene/prop-1-ene and alanine mirror/rotation conditions. The actual original image shows legitimate conformational, enantiomeric and E/Z examples; its E/trans and Z/cis labels fit its specifically drawn dichloroethene. The stereocentre prerequisite supports the tetrahedral case. HE page36 places extended E/Z at LK; no national GK duty follows.",
