      "essentialUnderstandingEn": "Barriers and protective films prevent contact, while active protection changes electrochemical roles; electrical/ionic contact and finite anode supply matter.",
      "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person erläutert intakte und beschädigte Polymer-, Cu- und Zn-Schichten, verfolgt Elektronen/Ionen und wägt Kosten sowie fehlende Umweltdaten ab.",
      "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner explains intact/damaged polymer, copper and zinc layers, tracks electrons/ions and weighs costs and missing environmental data.",
      "transferExpectationDe": "Bei verbrauchtem oder elektrisch isoliertem Zn unterscheidet sie ausfallenden aktiven Schutz von eventuell fortbestehender passiver Barriere.",
      "transferExpectationEn": "With consumed or electrically isolated zinc, they distinguish failed active protection from a possibly remaining passive barrier.",
      "rationale": "The whole current cases state potentials, moisture, contact and neglected film effects. They correctly predict Fe attack at a Cu defect and Zn oxidation protecting Fe; the ecological/economic comparison remains conditional rather than inventing a winner. The original bound image shows passive defects, sacrificial and impressed-current protection consistently. The existing corrosion prerequisite supplies the basic cell explanation, and this goal adds a meaningful explicit evaluation rather than repeating it. Actual BY C13 eA and HE page45 support corrosion-protection components.",
